{"strongs": "H7998", "word": "שָׁלָל", "translit": "sha.lal", "root": "שלל", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "prey, spoil, plunder, booty", "definition": "שָׁלָל 75 noun masculine 1Sam 30:16 prey, spoil, plunder, booty ; — absolute ׳ שׁ Gen 49:27 +; construct שְׁלַל Judg 5:30 +, suffix שְׁלָלֵךְ Zech 14:1 , שְׁלַלְכֶם Isa 33:4 , etc.; — 1. prey , of Benjamin as wolf Gen 49:27 (poem in J ; with חִלֵּק ). 2. booty, spoil of war, of all kinds (often || בַּז ): including garments, gold and silver Josh 7:21 ( J ), ornaments Judg 8:24 ; Judg 8:25 , fabrics and women Judg 5:30 a, b, flocks and herds 1Sam 30:20 ; Jer 49:32 ; 2Chr 15:11 , + persons Deut 20:14 (twice in verse), garments, food and drink 2Chr 28:15 , etc. (58 t.; among these) שְׁלַל הֶעָרִים Deut 2:25 ; 2Sam 12:30 ; 1Chr 20:2 and (+ cattle in addition) Deut 3:7 ; Josh 8:27 ; Josh 11:14 (both R D ), compare (also of city) Isa 8:4 ; Deut 13:17 (twice in verse); Zech 14:1 and (+ cattle) Josh 8:2 ( R D ), but including person and cattle Deut 20:14 , compare v Deut 20:14 figurative of entire nation Jer 50:10 ; Ezek 7:21 ; Zech 2:13 ׳ שׁ in symbolic proper name ׳ מַהֵר שָׁלָל וגו Isa 8:1 ; Isa 8:3 , see above p.555:a; ׳ שׁ in metaphor of future majesty of ׳ עֶבֶד י Isa 53:12 ׳ וְהֳיְתָהאלּוֺ נַפְשׁוֺ לְשׁ i.e. life shall be spared, Jer 21:9 ; Jer 38:2 ; Jer 39:18 , compare Jer 45:5 . 3. private plunder Isa 10:2 ( אַלְמָנוֺת שְׁלָלָם ), Prov 1:13 and (perhaps in current saying) Prov 16:19 . 4. = gain Prov 31:11 . — ׳ לְצַוִּארֵי שׁ Judg 5:30 c is clearly wrong; meaning dubious (see especially GFM ); plausible conjectures are ׳ לְצַוָּארַי שׁ for my neck as spoil , Reuss Br and others, and לְצַוְּארֵי שֵׁגָל for the neck of the queen Ew Be Kit and others (but שֵׁגָל elsewhere late); Now strike out שָׁלָל and reads לְצַוָּארָיו .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8732')\">BDB8732</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7998')\">H7998</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"b