\"30\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,30)\">Judg 5:30</ref> a, b, flocks and herds <ref ref=\"1Sam 30:20\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(9,30,20)\">1Sam 30:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 49:32\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(24,49,32)\">Jer 49:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 15:11\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(14,15,11)\">2Chr 15:11</ref>, + persons <ref ref=\"Deut 20:14\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(5,20,14)\">Deut 20:14</ref> (twice in verse), garments, food and drink <ref ref=\"2Chr 28:15\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(14,28,15)\">2Chr 28:15</ref>, etc. (58 t.; among these) <bdbheb>שְׁלַל הֶעָרִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 2:25\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(5,2,25)\">Deut 2:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 12:30\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(10,12,30)\">2Sam 12:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 20:2\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(13,20,2)\">1Chr 20:2</ref> and (+ cattle in addition) <ref ref=\"Deut 3:7\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(5,3,7)\">Deut 3:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 8:27\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(6,8,27)\">Josh 8:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 11:14\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(6,11,14)\">Josh 11:14</ref> (both <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('R')\"><reflink>R</reflink><sup><reflink>D</reflink></sup></lookup>), compare (also of city) <ref ref=\"Isa 8:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,8,4)\">Isa 8:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 13:17\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(5,13,17)\">Deut 13:17</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Zech 14:1\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(38,14,1)\">Zech 14:1</ref> and (+ cattle) <ref ref=\"Josh 8:2\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(6,8,2)\">Josh 8:2</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('R')\"><reflink>R</reflink><sup><reflink>D</reflink></sup></lookup>), but including person and cattle <ref ref=\"Deut 20:14\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(5,20,14)\">Deut 20:14</ref>, compare v<ref ref=\"Deut 20:14\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(5,20,14)\">Deut 20:14</ref> figurative of entire nation <ref ref=\"Jer 50:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(24,50,10)\">Jer 50:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 7:21\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(26,7,21)\">Ezek 7:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 2:13\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(38,2,13)\">Zech 2:13</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> in symbolic proper name <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מַהֵר שָׁלָל וגו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 8:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,8,1)\">Isa 8:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 8:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,8,3)\">Isa 8:3</ref>, <b>see</b> above p.555:a; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> in metaphor of future majesty of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עֶבֶד י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 53:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"53\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"53\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,53,12)\">Isa 53:12</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וְהֳיְתָהאלּוֺ נַפְשׁוֺ לְשׁ</bdbheb> i.e. life shall be spared, <ref ref=\"Jer 21:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(24,21,9)\">Jer 21:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 38:2\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(24,38,2)\">Jer 38:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 39:18\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(24,39,18)\">Jer 39:18</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Jer 45:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,45,5)\">Jer 45:5</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> private <highlight>plunder</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 10:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,2)\">Isa 10:2</ref> (<bdbheb>אַלְמָנוֺת שְׁלָלָם</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Prov 1:13\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(20,1,13)\">Prov 1:13</ref> and (perhaps in current saying) <ref ref=\"Prov 16:19\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(20,16,19)\">Prov 16:19</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> = <highlight>gain</highlight> <ref ref=\"Prov 31:11\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(20,31,11)\">Prov 31:11</ref>. — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לְצַוִּארֵי שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 5:30\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,30)\">Judg 5:30</ref> c is clearly wrong; meaning dubious (see especially <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('GFM')\">GFM</lookup>); plausible conjectures are <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לְצַוָּארַי שׁ</bdbheb> <highlight>for my neck as spoil</highlight>, Reuss<sup>Br</sup> and others, and <bdbheb>לְצַוְּארֵי שֵׁגָל</bdbheb> <highlight>for the neck of the queen</highlight> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Be')\">Be</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kit')\">Kit</lookup> and others (but <bdbheb>שֵׁגָל</bdbheb> elsewhere late); <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Now')\">Now</lookup> strike out <bdbheb>שָׁלָל</bdbheb> and reads <bdbheb>לְצַוָּארָיו</bdbheb>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "1Sam 30:16", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 30, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Gen 49:27", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 49, "verse": 27}, {"raw": "Judg 5:30", "book": "JDG", "chapt